ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Buenos días{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¿Sabes qué día es hoy?{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
¡El día del solsticio de verano!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hoooola{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!
¡Hoy brillará el sol el día entero!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡De verdad, no es broma!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Cuánto sol!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡Y lo mejor de todo es que
seguirá así el resto del día!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}I still can't believe it, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
The sun is never going to set today!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}I love that SO much, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Cioè, dico, è pazzesco, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Oggi il sole non tramonterà mai!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}'Sta cosa mi piace una cifra,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hello, hello, hello{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}I'm still greeting the day today...{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
because the sun hasn't gone down!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ciaaao{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Oggi non faccio altro che
mettermi la crema solare...{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Eh sì, il sole non è ancora
tramontato!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Buonasera? Macché sera e sera{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Il sole non è tramontato!
Non è una cosa da urlo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?
